description 44 has the description "2. Each year, the Executive Director shall draw up a draft single programming document, as referred to in paragraph 1, with the corresponding financial and human resources planning in accordance with Article 32 of Commission Delegated Regulation (EU) 2019/715 and taking into account the guidelines set by the Commission. 3. By 30 November each year, the Management Board shall adopt the single programming document referred to in paragraph 1, taking into account the opinion of the Commission referred to in Article 32(7) of Delegated Regulation (EU) 2019/715. If the Management Board decides not to take into account any elements of the opinion of the Commission, it shall provide thorough justification for that decision. The Management Board shall forward the single programming document to the European Parliament, to the Council and to the Commission by 31 January of the following year, as well as any subsequently updated versions of that document.".


