description 57 has the description "3.Where technical specifications are referenced in a European cybersecurity certification scheme as referred to in Article 74(10), they shall be made available on the website referred to in Article 79. 4. In duly justified cases, in particular where the technical specifications contain information could compromise the security of certified ICT products, ICT services, ICT processes, managed security services or cyber posture of entities, they shall be distributed only to those stakeholders concerned by the requirements of the scheme. Such scheme shall not be referenced in a European cybersecurity certification scheme as referred to in Article 74(10).".


